{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 594916, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 123073, "uid": 109198, "type": 4, "title": "最不舍的全职天子", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1689397061, "updated_at": 1695021650, "updated_uid": 109198, "comment_at": 1689670847, "last_at": 1695086747, "comment_count": 14, "status": 1, "summary": "最不舍的PVP队（刚好五职业）以及五个职业的五个天子，共计三十位。哎——————————————————————————————————2023.7最近两个月，围绕剪刀妹组了一套有点意思的PVP队伍，", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_760/h_2098/1069/109198/2023/8/18/93399.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_524/h_405/1069/109198/2023/6/15/367945.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7129, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "浙江省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 12, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 594916, "content": "<div>最不舍的PVP队（刚好五职业）以及五个职业的五个天子，共计三十位。</div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"760\" data-height=\"2098\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_760/h_2098/1069/109198/2023/8/18/93399.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_760/h_2098/1069/109198/2023/8/18/93399.png\"></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>哎——————————————————————————————————</div>2023.7最近两个月，围绕剪刀妹组了一套有点意思的PVP队伍，暂且叫“全职三刀队”。<div><span style=\"color:rgb(246,9,9);font-size:13.9999px;\">（当时给自己设定的目标是，“我不认可没有剪刀妹的胜利”）</span><br><div><br></div><div>打了20230710-0715 这几天，有一夜系统升级没打成，大概1000票，成绩还不错。</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"524\" data-height=\"405\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_524/h_405/1069/109198/2023/6/15/367945.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_524/h_405/1069/109198/2023/6/15/367945.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">1. 红莲，S</div><div class=\"div-img\">人偶：摩根</div><div class=\"div-img\">2. 水伞，S</div><div class=\"div-img\">人偶：伊芙</div><div class=\"div-img\">3. 老八<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，S</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">人偶：摩根</div><div class=\"div-img\">4. 千叶<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，S</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">人偶：队长加速就可以</div><div class=\"div-img\">5. 剪刀妹<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，N</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">人偶：管家</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; color: rgb(246, 9, 9);\">因为剪刀妹是2个刀刃+1个老八，所以是三刀（好吧，这是我胡诌的）。。。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(246, 9, 9);\">全职=五个职业，这没啥说的（有人让我下次挑战五色队。。。）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">DS: 红莲1，老八2</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">屏蔽：反伤盾，光击剑。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">联合buff：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">毕竟就一个辅助，</span>选哪个都行，习惯辅助+10%就这个吧。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">这套最大的优点：不会成为毒瘤！因为剪刀妹防守优先打S，会被锤烂的。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">最后，希望阵容越来越多样，大家一起营造舒适的PVP环境~</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><br></div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_760/h_2098/1069/109198/2023/8/18/93399.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_524/h_405/1069/109198/2023/6/15/367945.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 109198, "username": "三刀侍极", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/6.png", "description": "一百三情飞龍", "follow_num": 40, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 4, "content_at": 92811188, "content_num": 15, "read_num": 119840, "like_num": 104}, "update_user": {"uid": 109198, "username": "三刀侍极", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/6.png", "description": "一百三情飞龍", "follow_num": 40, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 4, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 109198, "username": "三刀侍极", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/6.png", "last_ip_area": "浙江省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/65